        "text": "#### [3] WSJ: Swarmchasers Forum Tracks Rogue AI Agents Across the Web\n* **What is confirmed:** *The Wall Street Journal* reported on October 3, 2026, on \"Swarmchasers,\" a 400-member Discord forum including research groups like Nightingale Collective and Transluce"
