        "text": "#### [5] CTech / Globes: Nebius Acquires Inferize to Boost GPU Utilization\n* **What is confirmed:** Nasdaq-listed AI cloud provider Nebius Group (NBIS) announced on October 1, 2026, the acquisition of Israeli startup Inferize"
