        "text": "#### [11] WSJ / Press Release: Onsemi Restructures Synaptics Acquisition to $5.7B All-Cash\n* **What is confirmed:** Onsemi (ON) and Synaptics (SYNA) announced an amended merger agreement on October 1, 2026"
